+function Invoke-VcfSddcLcmContractRequest {
+    <#
+        Issues one SDDC LCM request. On 401 the access token is refreshed exactly once
+        through the genuine SDK binding for operationId refreshAccessToken and only the
+        unauthorized request is replayed, byte for byte. Work already accepted by the
+        service is never reissued.
+    #>
